Retro Chess — licence

What this licence covers: the code and documents in this repository written for Retro Chess (game/, tools/, docs/,
native/CMakeLists.txt and the build scripts), released under the MIT licence below. You may reuse, change and
share them, for any purpose, as long as you keep this notice: credit "Retro Chess by BigFatDeuce" and link to
https://github.com/BigFatDeuce/retro-chess-game.

What it does not cover:
- native/thirdparty/stockfish: Stockfish 11, by the Stockfish developers, GPLv3 (see its Copying.txt).
- native/src (the engine extension built with Stockfish): GPLv3, like Stockfish. The game as distributed (it links
  Stockfish) is subject to the GPLv3 as a whole; MIT code is compatible with it.
- game/assets/fonts: Fredoka and Nunito, SIL Open Font License (see the OFL files next to them).
- The creatures, scenery, sounds and music of the game are from Dofus Retro, © Ankama. They are not in this
  repository and are not covered by any licence here; the tools rebuild them from a Dofus Retro install.

